msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Welcome to Q4OS"
msgstr "Selamat datang di Q4OS"

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "This is Q4OS"
msgstr "Inilah Q4OS"

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "We hope you'll enjoy your operating system."
msgstr "Kami harap Anda menikmati sistem operasi Anda."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Thank you for choosing us."
msgstr "Terima kasih telah memilih kami."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "A great desktop OS"
msgstr "Sistem operasi desktop yang hebat"

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Q4OS is Free and Open Source."
msgstr "Q4OS adalah perangkat lunak bebas dan sumber terbuka."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Tens of thousands free software applications are available from package manager."
msgstr "Puluhan ribu aplikasi perangkat lunak bebas tersedia dari manajer paket."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Out of the box"
msgstr "Siap pakai"

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Google Chrome, Firefox, Thunderbird and LibreOffice are easily installable, so you can get started with the desktop and the Internet."
msgstr "Google Chrome, Firefox, Thunderbird, dan LibreOffice mudah dipasang, sehingga Anda dapat langsung mulai menggunakan desktop dan Internet."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Other popular applications <!--such as Skype, Dropbox, TeamViewer, Opera and more -->can be installed with a click of the mouse."
msgstr "Aplikasi populer lainnya <!--seperti Skype, Dropbox, TeamViewer, Opera, dan lainnya -->dapat dipasang dengan satu klik tetikus."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Q4OS is compatible with most popular file formats: zip, doc, xls, pdf, rar, mp3, wmv, mpg, mp4, mkv, avi, mov ...etc"
msgstr "Q4OS kompatibel dengan sebagian besar format berkas populer: zip, doc, xls, pdf, rar, mp3, wmv, mpg, mp4, mkv, avi, mov ...dll"

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "An alternative to mainstream operating systems"
msgstr "Alternatif untuk sistem operasi arus utama"

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Q4OS is easy to use, powerful and configurable."
msgstr "Q4OS mudah digunakan, andal, dan dapat dikonfigurasi."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "It's safe and stable, you don't need an antivirus, an anti-spyware, a defragmentation tool or a registry cleaner."
msgstr "Aman dan stabil, Anda tidak memerlukan antivirus, anti-spyware, alat defragmentasi, atau pembersih registri."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Q4OS can detect other operating systems and install itself beside them. You can choose which operating system to launch when you start the computer."
msgstr "Q4OS dapat mendeteksi sistem operasi lain dan memasang dirinya di samping sistem tersebut. Anda dapat memilih sistem operasi mana yang dijalankan saat komputer dinyalakan."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Safe updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan yang aman"

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "The Q4OS update manager watches your system and shows an upgrade icon as soon as updates become available."
msgstr "Manajer pembaruan Q4OS memantau sistem Anda dan menampilkan ikon pembaruan segera setelah pembaruan tersedia."

msgctxt "show|"
msgid "Software updates and security updates are provided, not only for the operating system but also for the software you install."
msgstr "Pembaruan perangkat lunak dan pembaruan keamanan disediakan, tidak hanya untuk sistem operasi tetapi juga untuk perangkat lunak yang Anda pasang."
